BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:The Rough Rider
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20261030
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20261102
DTSTAMP:20261108T170658Z
UID:30fcd5142bb3aaa1b81f050f@visitarizona-calendar
DESCRIPTION:Blends world-class riding with a uniquely local spirit—drawi
 ng on the legacy of frontier hero Buckey O’Neill and the rough-and-ready
  cavalrymen of the Spanish-American War. Featuring epic routes through the
  Prescott National Forest and beyond\, the race delivers challenging terra
 in\, scenic backcountry\, and legendary vibes in one of Arizona’s most i
 conic adventure destinations.\n\nEvent website: https://www.roughridergrav
 el.com/\n\nVisit Arizona listing: https://www.visitarizona.com/events/the-
 rough-rider
LAST-MODIFIED:20261108T170658Z
LOCATION:Prescott Downtown Partnership\, East Gurley Street\, Prescott\, A
 Z\, USA
URL:https://www.visitarizona.com/events/the-rough-rider
END:VEVENT
