 n. The festival features a week of outdoor painting\, special exhibitions\
 , engaging workshops\, and free community events.\n\nEvent website: https:
 //sedonaartscenter.org/events\n\nVisit Arizona listing: https://www.visita
 rizona.com/events/22nd-annual-sedona-plein-air-festival
